    "id": "p1",
    "text": "A structural architecture decision should be written down before implementation starts.",
    "explanation": "Undocumented decisions get re-litigated and repeat past mistakes. Writing context, alternatives, and trade-offs down is what lets a future decision build on a past one instead of re-deriving it.",
